OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FFine and dry
OL,6,Fat first, with any early evening
OL,7,Fsunshine becoming increasingly hazy.
OL,8,FCloud will steadily thicken from the
OL,9,Fwest, bringing outbreaks of light rain
OL,10,Fovernight. Becoming breezy, especially
OL,11,Falong the coast, with the rain turning
OL,12,Fheavier around dawn.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTuesday:FRain, persistent through the
OL,15,Fmorning, will gradually move
OL,16,Feastwards, clearing Kent by mid-
OL,17,Fafternoon. Dry conditions will follow,
OL,18,Fwith sunny spells for most, although
OL,19,Fit will become increasingly breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
