OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FSunny
OL,6,Fspells and isolated showers Wednesday,
OL,7,Fwind easing. Mostly dry Thursday, with
OL,8,Fhazy sunshine. Early rain and breeze
OL,9,FFriday clearing later. Temperatures
OL,10,Faround average for early September.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
